WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.268 line:0%
Finally, New Rule,
there's nothing wrong

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:04.336 line:0%
with not having
an opinion on something.

00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:06.572 line:0%
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-Especially if you don't know

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.074 line:0%
what the fuck
you're talking about.

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:13.012 line:0%
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:14.647 line:0%
And if you're getting your facts

00:00:14.713 --> 00:00:17.016 line:0%
from TikTok and Instagram
and Facebook,

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:18.618 line:0%
I don't wanna hear
your hot take

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:20.286 line:0%
on asymmetrical warfare

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:21.687 line:0%
because there's a term
for someone

00:00:21.787 --> 00:00:23.522 line:0%
who gets their news
from Facebook.

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:29.161 line:0%
-"Mom."
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:00:29.228 --> 00:00:30.230
(CHUCKLES)

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:34.233
You know,
among the worst things

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.103
that social media ever did
was it made everyone feel

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.805
they had to weigh in
on every controversial issue

00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:41.374
or breaking news story, and...

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.608
(CHUCKLES) ...that's my job.

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.778
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:45.745
In the olden days,

00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:48.381
people would watch
the evening news and then,

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:49.749
well, nothing.

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:51.050
-They went on--
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:52.451
They went on with their lives.

00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:55.188
But today,
everybody's got to share

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:56.789
their theory on everything.

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:58.958
Whether it's trans women
on the swim team

00:00:59.024 --> 00:01:00.927
or whether dwarfs
should play non-dwarfs

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.195
in the<i> Snow White</i> movie.

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:08.501
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(SIGHS)

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:13.306
But has anyone noticed
that the more time

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:15.374
everyone spends telling
everyone else

00:01:15.441 --> 00:01:17.343
their political position
on everything,

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:19.345
the more we've been
at each other's throats.

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:21.947
Here's a trend I would love
to see on Twitter.

00:01:22.081 --> 00:01:23.249
"No opinion."

00:01:23.482 --> 00:01:28.687
-(DONNA BRAZILE LAUGHING)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:32.125
Where people take issues
like the debt limit

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:33.693
and climate science
and post,

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.327
"I don't know shit about this."

00:01:35.394 --> 00:01:39.598
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-(DONNA CHUCKLING)

00:01:39.665 --> 00:01:41.000
Thursday is Thanksgiving,

00:01:41.066 --> 00:01:44.136
the cherished yearly celebration
when distant friends

00:01:44.203 --> 00:01:46.606
and scattered family members
gather together

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:50.876
-to fight about Donald Trump...
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:01:51.176 --> 00:01:52.244
...the other butterball.

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:57.116
-(DONNA LAUGHING)
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:01:57.182 --> 00:01:58.651
-(DONNA SIGHING)
-(LAUGHS)

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:02.588
But not just Trump,
we'll also argue about abortion

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:05.391
and critical race theory
and guns and prisons

00:02:05.457 --> 00:02:08.094
and schools, and this year,
we're fighting about Israel.

00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:09.395
But here's the thing,

00:02:09.461 --> 00:02:11.597
you're not actually
legally obliged

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:12.698
to have an opinion.

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:15.201
Do you know why the Indians
and the pilgrims

00:02:15.267 --> 00:02:17.970
were able to sit peaceably
through the first Thanksgiving?

00:02:18.203 --> 00:02:20.306
Because nobody
brought up politics.

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:22.709
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:02:23.275 --> 00:02:24.410
That's true.

00:02:26.345 --> 00:02:28.280
Even though I'm sure the Indians

00:02:28.347 --> 00:02:30.549
had strong feelings
about immigration.

00:02:30.616 --> 00:02:36.689
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-True.

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:44.130
Back in the '90s,
Michael Jordan famously said

00:02:44.196 --> 00:02:46.165
he stayed out of politics
because quote,

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:48.400
"Republicans buy sneakers too."

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:50.536
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:02:50.603 --> 00:02:53.105
And then Kanye said,
"And don't forget Nazis."

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:57.109
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:58.411
(CHUCKLES)

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:02.815
But the days
when someone could say that

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:04.717
and keep their opinions
to themselves,

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:05.918
those days are gone.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.387
Big Brother says
that having no opinion

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:09.722
is not an option anymore.

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:12.758
You must participate
in this online circle jerk

00:03:13.025 --> 00:03:15.594
-or you'll be--
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:03:15.661 --> 00:03:18.030
Or you will be seen
as an insensitive prick

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:20.799
who's single-handedly
obstructing much-needed progress

00:03:20.866 --> 00:03:21.867
in the world.

00:03:22.501 --> 00:03:26.605
-Did you post a black square?
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:03:26.672 --> 00:03:29.275
No? Well, that's why
there's still racism.

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:36.082
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(SIGHS)

00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:40.152
(LAUGHS)
You see, here's what it is,

00:03:40.285 --> 00:03:43.255
the younger generations
were raised wrong.

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:44.824
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:46.625
So they can't stand,
for a minute,

00:03:46.692 --> 00:03:47.994
the idea that other people

00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:49.828
have opinions different
than their own.

00:03:49.895 --> 00:03:52.031
Fifty-nine percent
of consumers now

00:03:52.265 --> 00:03:54.700
will buy a product,
or boycott a product,

00:03:54.833 --> 00:03:56.769
based solely
on the political stance

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:57.970
a company takes.

00:03:58.237 --> 00:04:00.406
Huh? Gen Z consumers need
to know

00:04:00.473 --> 00:04:02.674
if their spermicide
condemns cockfighting.

00:04:02.808 --> 00:04:09.549
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:04:11.651 --> 00:04:14.353
Disney didn't wanna get
into a big pissing match

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.922
with Ron DeSantis
about sex in grade school.

00:04:17.056 --> 00:04:19.892
But its employees sure did,
so they had to.

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:22.595
Now, one side thinks Disney
said too much,

00:04:22.662 --> 00:04:24.730
the other thinks
it didn't say enough.

00:04:24.997 --> 00:04:26.699
We see this pattern
over and over.

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:28.267
We saw it with Bud Light,

00:04:28.834 --> 00:04:31.337
when they did ads
with a trans influencer,

00:04:31.471 --> 00:04:33.372
and MAGA nation thought
it was a plot

00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:35.174
to use beer to turn them gay.

00:04:35.274 --> 00:04:39.912
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:04:39.979 --> 00:04:43.015
Pride Month is now a minefield
for corporations.

00:04:43.082 --> 00:04:45.951
This year, Target put up
special rainbow displays

00:04:46.018 --> 00:04:48.988
which presented Christians
who oppose gay marriage

00:04:49.255 --> 00:04:50.656
with an impossible choice,

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.826
either support a gay lifestyle
and go to hell for it

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:55.594
or shop at Kohl's.

00:04:55.761 --> 00:05:02.602
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-(SIGHS)

00:05:04.803 --> 00:05:06.738
And why did I ever need to know

00:05:06.805 --> 00:05:10.075
that Chick-fil-A
is chicken that's "Christian"?

00:05:10.443 --> 00:05:14.580
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-Can't it just be chicken?

00:05:15.414 --> 00:05:18.451
This is unsustainable.
It's unsustainable.

00:05:18.517 --> 00:05:20.920
To politicize everything
means we're always fighting

00:05:20.986 --> 00:05:22.921
because we don't all agree
and never will,

00:05:23.021 --> 00:05:26.124
and most people don't want
to be forced to say anything.

00:05:26.358 --> 00:05:27.794
Kylie Jenner posted,

00:05:27.927 --> 00:05:29.829
"We stand
with the people of Israel."

00:05:30.029 --> 00:05:31.196
And then deleted it,

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:34.033
which is pretty much
the opposite of standing with.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:41.074
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:05:42.808 --> 00:05:44.643
One executive
who was interviewed

00:05:44.743 --> 00:05:46.945
about the pressure
companies have felt

00:05:47.079 --> 00:05:49.615
to make a statement
about the Hamas war said...

00:05:49.915 --> 00:05:55.587
(READS PROMPT)

00:05:55.721 --> 00:05:58.057
Exactly.
And I bet you still don't,

00:05:58.124 --> 00:05:59.692
so why not
just shut the fuck up.

00:05:59.758 --> 00:06:05.597
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)
-I don't need-- (CHUCKLES)

00:06:06.164 --> 00:06:09.568
I don't need to be reminded
that Spanx's stretchy pants

00:06:09.668 --> 00:06:12.571
-are against racism.
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

00:06:12.638 --> 00:06:15.140
I don't care
who Frito Lay stands with.

00:06:15.207 --> 00:06:17.209
You make bean dip, just do that.

00:06:17.276 --> 00:06:23.482
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING, APPLAUDING)

00:06:23.548 --> 00:06:25.084
Stop making everything

00:06:25.184 --> 00:06:27.286
about some other
random deeper shit.

00:06:27.352 --> 00:06:29.354
When I hear,
"Astroglide want you to know

00:06:29.421 --> 00:06:30.957
that they support--" Stop.

00:06:31.023 --> 00:06:32.992
-(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)
-You lost me.

00:06:33.058 --> 00:06:34.727
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:06:34.794 --> 00:06:38.697
-I don't want-- (LAUGHS)
-(AUDIENCE CHEERING, APPLAUDING)

00:06:38.764 --> 00:06:40.166
I don't want to--

00:06:40.232 --> 00:06:42.268
I don't wanna live
in this annoying world

00:06:42.334 --> 00:06:44.336
where "they"
can't drink Bud Light

00:06:44.403 --> 00:06:46.138
and we can't eat Chick-fil-A.

00:06:46.204 --> 00:06:48.207
I'm sick of all of it.
This Thanksgiving,

00:06:48.274 --> 00:06:50.142
I'm gonna make beer can chicken

00:06:50.209 --> 00:06:53.212
-with Bud Light and Chick-fil-A.
-(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:06:53.279 --> 00:06:56.082
And anybody who doesn't like it
can go fuck themselves.

00:06:56.182 --> 00:06:58.084
Happy Thanksgiving, everybody!

